wrote reports/eval_game.json

NOTE ON COVERAGE
  The RAPM arm is limited to the players in its published leaderboard,
  which applies a possession floor. The floor exists for display, not
  for evaluation, and it caps this arm's coverage below the box-score
  arms'. To remove the handicap, refit with the floors disabled and
  point --rapm-stem at that output:
    python3 scripts/fit_ridge_rapm.py --prefix rapm_eval --alpha <a> \
        --min-poss 0 --min-games 0 --bootstrap 0 --out rapm_eval_full
